1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
18 minutes, two South Africa goals

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:12,400
South Africa 0–1 · 67:01 on the broadcast clock (real speed)

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,000
Replay at one-third speed

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,114
South Africa carried the ball about 47 m down the near side in two runs,

5
00:00:18,114 --> 00:00:24,012
from just inside Kenya's half to the corner of the area, in about 7 seconds.

6
00:00:24,012 --> 00:00:29,075
A Kenya defender ran alongside the carrier the whole way and never got goal-side,

7
00:00:29,075 --> 00:00:32,888
so the ball could be played across the six-yard area.

8
00:00:32,888 --> 00:00:37,160
The finish came from about 4 m in a crowded six-yard area.

9
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:43,600
The footage does not show the last touch clearly, so no scorer is named.

10
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:50,300
South Africa 0–2 · 85:38 on the broadcast clock (real speed)

11
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:50,900
Replay at one-third speed

12
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:56,618
South Africa moved the ball through a crowd of Kenya players at the edge of the area:

13
00:00:56,618 --> 00:01:00,616
two passes of about 9 m and 10 m in under 2 seconds.

14
00:01:00,616 --> 00:01:05,046
The second pass put a runner inside the area about 11 m from goal,

15
00:01:05,046 --> 00:01:09,372
beyond the Kenya players who had stepped toward the ball.

16
00:01:09,372 --> 00:01:13,259
The goal came about 4 seconds after the first pass.

17
00:01:13,259 --> 00:01:19,800
The finish is too small to read at this resolution, so no scorer is named.

18
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:25,400
Kenya 1–2 · 87:58 on the broadcast clock (real speed)

19
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,000
Replay at one-third speed

20
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,613
Kenya's goal came from a free kick on the far side, about 40 m from goal,

21
00:01:31,613 --> 00:01:34,804
delivered about 33 m into the area.

22
00:01:34,804 --> 00:01:38,813
More than ten players were inside the area when it was struck,

23
00:01:38,813 --> 00:01:43,968
and the ball was finished from about 6 m two seconds after the delivery.

24
00:01:43,968 --> 00:01:48,670
Several South African players raised their arms after the finish.

25
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:55,356
The footage does not show why or who made the last touch, so no scorer is named.

